  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZR 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abayuda bagotangwa tibaagacha Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono ekero ababisa b’Abayuda, na ab’Ababenjamini baigwete ng’a abanto baria bairanire korwa ase obosomba naende ng’a nkoagachera bare Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, Hekalu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakagenda ase Serubabeli, na ase abateneneri be chiamate chiabo, bakabateebia, “Tiga tobaagachisie, naintwe nabo togosasiima Nyasae oino buna inwe mogokora, na ase chingaki korwa kare gese Esari‐Hadoni, omorwoti bw’Abaasuri, oria otorentete aiga, twabeire tokorwa ebing’wanso ase Nyasae oyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Serubabeli, na Yesua, na abateneneri bande be chiamate chi’Abaisraeli, bakabakania, bakabateebia, “Inwe timogwenereti motoagachisie enyomba ya Nyasae oito, korende nintwe tweka toraagachere Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, enyomba, buna Koresi, omorwoti bw’Abaayemi atochigeete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto b’ense eria bagaita Abayuda emioyo, bakaboboyia ng’a tibagenderera koagacha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abwo bakarenta abasemia baare goakanerwa, nabwo bakaba bakorua ogosemia okobe gosaria emeroberio yabo, bakaba bagokora igo korwa amatuko ’okogamba gwa Koresi, omorwoti bw’Abaayemi, goikera ay’okogamba kwa Dario, omorwoti bw’Abaayemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogotangwa gw’okoagacha Yerusalemu naende",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omochakano bw’okogamba kw’Ahaswero, ababisa baria bakarika amang’ana ay’ogosoera abanto bamenyete ase orogongo rw’Abayuda, na ase Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende ase amatuko ’okogamba kw’Aritasasita, omorwoti bw’Abaayemi, Bisilamu, na Mitiredati, na Tabeeli, na abanto bande babwataine komo, bakarikera Aritasasita riruube ase chinuguta chi’Ekearamaiki na ase omonwa oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo Rehumu, omosemia omonene, na Simusai omoriki, bakarikera Aritasasita riruube bagosoera Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Rehemu, omosemia omonene, na Simusai omoriki, na abande babwataine nabarabwo: abagaambi ebiina, na abagabana, na abanene b’oborwoti, na Abaayemi, na Abaereki, na Abaababeli, na Abasusa korwa ase ense y’Abaelamu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na abanto b’ebisaku binde biria Osinapari, oyorenge omonene naende osikire, arentete, akababeeka komenya ase emechie ya Samaria na ase chinsemo chinde chi’orogongo roria, bosongo y’orooche rw’Eufarati, bakarika riruube.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro amang’ana e riruube riria riarigetwe: “Ase Aritasasita omorwoti. Intwe abasomba bao aba tomenyete aiga bosongo y’orooche rw’Eufarati, twagokwanirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye omorwoti, bono manya ng’a Abayahudi aba barua asore, bagacha ase tore aiga Yerusalemu, bachakire koagacha omochie oria oichire nogosaria na obobe. Nigo bare ang’e gokoora chindwaki chiaye na koroisia amaroso aye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omorwoti, manya ng’a onye omochie oyo okoagachwa naende, ne chindwaki chiere koagachwa, rirorio abanto aba tibakorua ebango, gose echogo y’ebinto babwate, gose ebango ye chinchera, na ebitoki bi’omorwoti nigo birakee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ekiagera intwe tokonyora omonyoo oito korwa ase enyomba yao, aye omorwoti, titogwancha korora aye gokorenterwa ogochaywa buna okwo. Ase ayio twatomire amang’ana ayio asore, aye omorwoti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erinde obotuki bokorwe ase chibuku aase amang’ana e chisokoro chiao ariikire. Nonyore korwa ase amang’ana arigetwe ase chibuku chiria ng’a omochie oyo noyo bw’obobe na ogotaigwera, obeire okorenta emechando ase abarwoti, na ase chingongo chionsi, naende ng’a eburu‐buru na ogosaria nigo biarengeo korwa kare. Ayio agerete omochie oyio ogasarigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intwe nigo togokomanyia, aye omorwoti, ng’a omochie oyo oise koagachwa naende, ne chindwaki chiaye chiagachwe chiere, rirorio orogongo rore bosongo y’orooche rw’Eufarati tirokoba orwao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti agatoma amairanerio aya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Ase Rehemu, omosemia omonene, na Simusai omoriki, na ase abanto baria bande babwataine nabarabwo bamenyete Samaria, boigo nase baria barenge ase orogongo rore bosongo y’orooche rw’Eufarati, nabakwanirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Riruube mwatoma gocha ase tore riasomirwe buya ase ’nde, nariigure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nachika, na obotuki bogakorwa na amang’ana akanyorekana ng’a omochie oyio korwa kare obeire okorwania abarwoti, na ogotaigwera, na eburu‐buru amo namariomana mbiarenge imeo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarwoti barenge nokobua babeire bakogambera Yerusalemu na orogongo rwonsi rore bosongo y’orooche rw’Eufarati, na abwo babeire bakorenterwa ebango na echogo y’ebinto na eye chinchera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio inwe karue ogochika ng’a abanto abwo batangwe batige gokora emeremo, erinde omochie oyio otigwe, toagachwa naende goika ekero inche ndarue ogochika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa goteebana ase amang’ana aya. Nase ki inche omorwoti ndanyore emechando?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwango obwo riruube ri’omorwoti Aritasasita riasometwe ase Rehumu, na ase Simusai omoriki, na ase abanto abwo babwatanete nabarabwo, barabwo bakagenda Yerusalemu bwango kegima ase Abayahudi, na ase chinguru bakabatenenia tibagenderera koagacha omochie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emeremo yokoagacha Hekalu egochaka nainde",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono emeremo yare gokorwa ase enyomba ya Nyasae agwo Yerusalemu egasiekwa kegima na ekaba egendererete gosiekwa goika omwaka o kabere bw’okogamba kwa Dario, omorwoti bw’Abaayemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
